    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iutarot e Daudi te nchetata e Nkaji e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiturrurro apa Daudi te Yerusalem ilkituaak pooki le Israel, ilkituaak loo loshon, o larikok le lelo turrurri apa ooisiaai olaiguanani, o larikok le njore le nkalifu, o larikok le njore le maa iip, o laitashiekinok loo masaa pooki, o nkishu o laiguanani, o layiok lenyena, tenebo o lkituaak le nkaji o laiguanani, o lelo tung'ana magil, o lelo murran pooki yiolot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7.1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.17.1+1KI.17.2+1KI.17.3+1KI.17.4+1KI.17.5+1KI.17.6+1KI.17.7+1KI.17.8+1KI.17.9+1KI.17.10+1KI.17.11+1KI.17.12+1KI.17.13+1KI.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 17.1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nedumunye Daudi aitashe nejo, “Entoning'oki nanu, ilalashera lainei oltung'ana laainei. Atadamua apa to ltau lai pee ashetu enkaji nairragieki osanduku lo sotua lo Laitoriani, neaku eneitasheyie nkejek e Nkai ang: naitobira nanu mbaa naashetieki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake aatiaka nanu Enkai, ‘Mindim iyie atesheta enkaji tenkaraki enkarna ai, amu ira iyie olmurrani nimbukoyie osarge sapuk.' ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake eyia aategelua nanu Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel te nkaji e papaai pooki pee aaku olaiguanani le Israel ntarasi, amu etegelua Yuda metaa olarikoni, naa ore te nkaji e Yuda, teina aji e papa, o tiatua ilayiok le papa neitishipa ninye pee aaitaa olaiguanani le Israel pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore too layiok laainei pooki (amu aaishoo Olaitoriani ilayiok kumok) netegelua Solomon olayioni lai, pee eton to lorika le nkitoo le nkitoria o Laitoriani te Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aatiaka ninye nanu, Solomon olayioni lino olo ashet enkaji ai o lgorieti laainei, amu ategelua nanu ninye metaa enkerai ai, naa kaaku nanu menye lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitasheyie nanu enkitoria enye ntarasi tenebik ninye aibung neitabaya nkitanapat aainei, o nkikoot aainei, anaa enatiu ninye taata.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata te dukuya Isirael pooki, ena umata o Laitoriani o te ning'oto e Nkai ang, entujurru ning'oruru nkitanapat pooki o Laitoriani Enkai inyi; pee itumutumu aawaita ena kop sidai aaitaa eninyi, ningueikiki nkera inyi metaa enjung'ore enye ntarasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naa ore iyie Solomon enkerai ai, tayiolo Enkai e papaai lino, nisiaai ninye to ltau pooki o te ndamunoto e yieunoto amu kejur Olaitoriani iltauja pooki, neyiolo pooki kitobirat o endamunoto. Tening'oru iyie ninye, naa eitum iyie ninye, kake tenilam ninye, naa eikinturraa ninye iyie ntarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toning'o naa taata, amu kitegelua iyie Olaitoriani pee ishet enkaji naaku ewueji sinyati; ntagoluoyu taasa ina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho Daudi Solomon eutaroto enkitobirata eina aji Enkai pooki, o enoo nkajijik enyena, o neeshumishoreki, o lgilat lenyena le shumata, o lgilat lenyena liatua, o lgilat lo lorika lolng'ur, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o nena kitobirat pooki naata to ltau, tenkaraki ilgorieti le nkaji o Laitoriani, o lgilat pooki oomanita, o wuejitin pooki neeshumishoreki e nkaji e Nkai, o eneshumieki nkishorot naaitisinyaki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tenkaraki lelo turrurri loo lapolosak o Lawi, o esiaai pooki enkisiaayiare tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani, o masaa pooki e nkisiaayiare tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o enkiroishi e sahabu tenkaraki imasaa e sahabu te pooki kisiaayiare, o enkiroishi oo masaa e nkosholai te pooki kisiayiare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O enkiroishi oo nkitasheta oo ltaai, lenye, o enkiroishi e pooki kitashet oltaa o ltaai lenyena, o enkiroishi enkosholai tenkaraki enkiteshet oltaa, o ltaai lenyena, te risioroto enkisiaayiarete pooki kitashet o ltaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O enkiroishi e sahabu te pooki mesa, e mukate e nkitoduaaroto, o enkosholai tenkaraki imisai naaitobiri te nkosholai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O sahabu nasila naitobirieki nkijikoni oo lala, o mbesenini, o nkikompeni, o nena girran e sahabu, o enkiroishi e sahabu naitobirieki pooki o ngirran e nkosholai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O te nkaraki olperere lo lasar le nkorropil le sahabu nasila, o enkiroishi e sahabu naitobirieki. Neisho sii nkitobirat tenkaraki engarri oo lbartan e sahabu nanapieki lelo kerubi oolak inaipuko enye aaitoip ilo sanduku lo sotua le Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eibalunye ninye kuna baa pooki too lkigerot le nkaina o Laitoriani, ooipirta ena bae. Keasi ena siaai pooki aaiturubare ina kitobirata e utaroto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Daudi ajoki Solomon ilo ayioni lenye, “Ntagoluoyu nintagol oshoke, niaas ina, miureishoyu, milepori nimishalu; amu ore Olaitoriani Enkai ai, ee Enkai ai, netii tenebo iyie, mikintiak ninye iyie nimikinguanare ometaba anaa neidipayu esiaai pooki e nkisiaayiare e nkaji Olaitoriani. Naa ng'ura, ore ilturrurri loo lapolosak; o loo Lawi, teina kisiaayiare pooki enkaji e Nkai, netii tenebo iyie, ometaba anaa neidipayu esiaai pooki e nkisiaayiare e nkaji Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ng'ura, ore ilturrurri loo lapolosak, o loo Lawi, teina kisiaayiare pooki enkaji e Nkai netii tenebo iyie, neeta ake pooki tung'ani eyieunoto, neeta pooki ng'ae enkarriyiano te pooki kisiaayiare; ore sii ilkituaak o ltung'ana pooki naa kening aakurraki tenintanap ninche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
